::  Girly Grange [nobr]

<<set $Location to {
    Name: "Girly Grange",
    Indoors: 1,
    Safe: 0,
    Nudity: 0,
    Public: 1,
    Environment: "Mall",
}>>
<<set _returnlink to "Girly Grange">>

<span style="color:Azure"><big><strong>--Girly Grange--</strong></big></span><br>
The store is almost blindingly pink, despite the clothes coming in a large variety of colors, and the floor is carpeted with an almost sickening design of swirling flowers. It also seems to sell everything from young girl’s clothes to older woman’s. Many of displayed on high-quality models and, as you look at some of the prices, you nearly gasp! Why are women’s clothes so much more expensive than boy’s!? A few of the workers, also dressed in pink, give you some strange looks, being a solo boy in the store, though they also seem far too busy to give you too much attention. <br>
<br>

				/* NPC SEEN */
<<include "NPC Inspect">>
